issue.body:
I don't understand UUID is  became AUTOPILOT_VERSION's uid.

To explain my situation I have five drones.
According to the example, when dronecore make a system that need UUID. 

like below
DroneCore dc;
//... 
//Use UUID named uuid to get the associated System
System &system = dc.system(uuid);

But in dronecore's UUID is declared AUTOPILOT_VERSION's uid. My five drones have same AUTOPILOT_VERSION's uid and have different system ID. So, my five drones collision each others. 
I have question, my AUTOPILOT_VERSION's uid are same is strange or dronecore's uuid is strange?

I would be grateful if you could help with this phenomenon.

